1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,210
Execution without a wallet extension.

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:09,940
Pylon's demo signer holds a key in the tab and signs the same ballot Rabby would.

3
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:15,880
Memory only. Never storage, never a request body.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:25,540
It is the owner of the live position: zero point zero four five seven BTC, two thousand and fifty-one MUSD, one hundred and eighty-one percent.

5
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:33,260
Size a loop: half a milli-BTC. The x-ray prices every leg before anything is signed.

6
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:41,290
Execute. The engine relays it, the signature authorises it, the position updates.

7
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:43,890
One signature. One transaction. One hash on the explorer.
